    <!-- 개인정보 안내 -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy and collected items</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">shorts monitor stores the following items only on this device:

• Observation sessions
• Shorts list and actual exposure order
• Suspected mid-insertion events
• Browser test profiles
• User verdicts and memos

No records are sent to external servers. Resetting cookies or site data keeps observation records. Exports never include raw cookies, auth tokens, login credentials, full HTML, cache, or video files.

Detection results are observed list-change clues and do not confirm the platform\'s intent or cause.</string>
